# Default Compose API. Use http://localhost:5065 for the native http profile.
@UUcars.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Public listing query
GET {{UUcars.API_HostAddress}}/cars?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Public brand and price filters
GET {{UUcars.API_HostAddress}}/cars?brand=Toyota&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=30000
Accept: application/json
